1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,860
Section B. Activity 1B. Listen and check the words you hear in 1A.

2
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:14,500
Hi, David. How are you? Are you okay?

3
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:16,700
No, I'm not.

4
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,400
What's wrong?

5
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,100
It's Tuesday.

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,340
So?

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,200
I have two math classes on Tuesday.

8
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,500
You don't like math?

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:33,700
No, it's so difficult. My father says it's interesting,

10
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:36,660
but I don't think so.

11
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:39,160
So, what's your favorite subject?

12
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:43,500
Chinese. It's difficult, but interesting.

13
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,320
When is your Chinese class?

14
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:51,300
It's on Monday, Wednesday, Thursday,

15
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,880
and Friday.

16
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:57,500
I have to go now. I have math, history,

17
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,620
and science this morning.

18
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:03,820
Okay. See you at music class. Bye.
